}}'''Frostfade''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 19th tier during the [[Christmas Event 2023|2023 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
This knife uses the default knife mesh. It has a blue blade which fades into purple at the bottom, hence the name. It has a metal finish that engraves onto the guard and expands onto the bottom of the blade and on the top of the handle.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Frostfade (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.

